# fixture identity: lantern
# fixture element: floor-lamp height proportions with a narrow body taller than its footprint
# fixture element: weighted base plus small foot pads
# fixture element: vertical stem and side frame posts around the light chamber
# fixture element: glowing core inside a muted shade cage
# fixture element: top cap with a small carry handle
# fixture element: asymmetrical side switch mounted on the right post
# fixture asymmetry: right-side switch and offset carry handle break rotation symmetry
# fixture stressor-silhouette: slender vertical forms with thin frame posts and narrow stem
# fixture stressor-material: bright/accent material handling between glow core, brass frame, dark metal, shade, and red switch materials
# fixture stressor-material: glow-like material intent without true bloom/transparency using solid emissive-colored voxels
# fixture stressor-view: silhouette stability across front and three-quarter views despite the compact cage and handle
model lantern
size 9 20 9
palette phase0Props
color darkIron #25272a
color warmBrass #b9863b
color lanternGlow #ffd66b
color smokyShade #5f5342
color switchRed #b74332
material metal darkIron
material brass warmBrass
material glow lanternGlow
material shade smokyShade
material accent switchRed

# weighted base and feet
fill metal 2..6 0..0 2..6
fill brass 3..5 1..1 3..5
voxel metal 1 0 4
voxel metal 7 0 4
voxel metal 4 0 1
voxel metal 4 0 7

# slender vertical stem below the light chamber
fill brass 4..4 2..8 4..4
fill metal 3..5 8..8 3..5

# glowing chamber, shade cage, and thin frame posts
fill glow 3..5 9..14 3..5
fill shade 2..6 9..14 2..2
fill shade 2..6 9..14 6..6
fill shade 2..2 9..14 3..5
fill shade 6..6 9..14 3..5
fill brass 2..2 9..15 2..2
fill brass 6..6 9..15 2..2
fill brass 2..2 9..15 6..6
fill brass 6..6 9..15 6..6

# top cap, carry handle, and asymmetric switch
fill metal 2..6 15..16 2..6
fill brass 3..5 17..17 3..5
voxel brass 3 18 4
voxel brass 4 19 4
voxel brass 5 18 4
fill accent 7..7 11..12 4..4
voxel accent 7 10 4
